{"id":"n57454-1-7","stage":4,"title":"몰아넣다 · 赶进","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n57454-1-7-1","ko":"할아버지, 양들이 풀을 다 먹었어요.","zh":"爷爷，羊把草吃完了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"할아버지,","meaning":"爷爷","explanation":"할아버지：爷爷","readings":[{"term":"할아버지","audio":"/audio/6600340ce9e158e7d903.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74121","senseId":"3","lemma":"할아버지","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"양들이","meaning":"羊","explanation":"양：羊；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象。；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"양","audio":"/audio/2ce295bd7785c9ad61fa.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14318","senseId":"1","lemma":"양","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"풀을","meaning":"草","explanation":"풀：草；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"풀","audio":"/audio/9f4ab3b56eddc42cf4c9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73268","senseId":"1","lemma":"풀","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"다","meaning":"全，都","explanation":"다：全，都","readings":[{"term":"다","audio":"/audio/822b7db6f6886f572413.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58175","senseId":"1","lemma":"다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"먹었어요.","meaning":"吃","explanation":"먹다：吃；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"먹다","audio":"/audio/9639f892bdddb53fc055.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58272","senseId":"1","lemma":"먹다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"6600340ce9e158e7","term":"할아버지","zh":"爷爷","audio":"/audio/6600340ce9e158e7d903.mp3","entryId":"74121","definition":"(亲近)用于指称或称呼年老的男性。","pronunciation":["하라버지"]},{"id":"2ce295bd7785c9ad","term":"양","zh":"羊","audio":"/audio/2ce295bd7785c9ad61fa.mp3","entryId":"14318","definition":"为获得毛和肉，而喂养的全身多白毛的温顺的动物。","pronunciation":["양"]},{"id":"9f4ab3b56eddc42c","term":"풀","zh":"草","audio":"/audio/9f4ab3b56eddc42cf4c9.mp3","entryId":"73268","definition":"一种茎秆柔软的植物，大部分为一年生。","pronunciation":["풀"]},{"id":"822b7db6f6886f57","term":"다","zh":"全，都","audio":"/audio/822b7db6f6886f572413.mp3","entryId":"58175","definition":"无剩余或遗漏，所有的。","pronunciation":["다ː"]},{"id":"9639f892bdddb53f","term":"먹다","zh":"吃","audio":"/audio/9639f892bdddb53fc055.mp3","entryId":"58272","definition":"将食物送进口中并咽下。","pronunciation":["먹따"]}],"audio":"/audio/40bae2da01550aed91a0.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n57454-1-7-2","ko":"그럼 이제 우리 안에 몰아넣거라.","zh":"那就把它们赶进羊圈吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그럼","meaning":"那么，既然那样","explanation":"그럼：那么，既然那样","readings":[{"term":"그럼","audio":"/audio/86f87d3fb9919f145d21.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60346","senseId":"2","lemma":"그럼","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"이제","meaning":"现在","explanation":"이제：现在","readings":[{"term":"이제","audio":"/audio/16ebe2403bccd648e89e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58621","senseId":"1","lemma":"이제","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"우리","meaning":"圈，窝，笼，舍","explanation":"우리：圈，窝，笼，舍","readings":[{"term":"우리","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70398","senseId":"1","lemma":"우리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"안에","meaning":"里，里面","explanation":"안：里，里面；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74890","senseId":"1","lemma":"안","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"몰아넣거라.","meaning":"赶进","explanation":"몰아넣다：赶进；거라：向亲近的人或晚辈发出指示、劝告或请求。","readings":[{"term":"몰아넣다","audio":"/audio/a9ea5ea7c45ee5701528.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57454","senseId":"1","lemma":"몰아넣다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"86f87d3fb9919f14","term":"그럼","zh":"那么，既然那样","audio":"/audio/86f87d3fb9919f145d21.mp3","entryId":"60346","definition":"用于表示接受前文内容，或以前文为基础，提出新的主张。","pronunciation":["그럼"]},{"id":"16ebe2403bccd648","term":"이제","zh":"现在","audio":"/audio/16ebe2403bccd648e89e.mp3","entryId":"58621","definition":"说话的同时。","pronunciation":["이제"]},{"id":"398dfa639dfd0db8","term":"우리","zh":"圈，窝，笼，舍","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3","entryId":"70398","definition":"蓄养畜类的地方。","pronunciation":["우리"]},{"id":"bc00bc8172c83d5f","term":"안","zh":"里，里面","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3","entryId":"74890","definition":"从某物体或空间的周围向着中间的方向；或指那样的部分。","pronunciation":["안"]},{"id":"a9ea5ea7c45ee570","term":"몰아넣다","zh":"赶进","audio":"/audio/a9ea5ea7c45ee5701528.mp3","entryId":"57454","definition":"强制性地往里赶。","pronunciation":["모라너타"]}],"audio":"/audio/f348d92d1ee38d44d093.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.4,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=57454","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":124,"sequenceScore":2.2267,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["爷爷，羊把草吃完了。","那就把它们赶进羊圈吧。","爸爸，早饭准备好了，请用餐。"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["爷爷，羊把草吃完了。","那就把它们赶进羊圈吧。","爸爸，早饭准备好了，请用餐。"],"answer":1}]}
